<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  3.82 %			C/S =  1.02 %</p>
<p>	    O/N =  3.82 %			O/N =  0.64 %</p>
<p>	    T/N =  3.82 %			T/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>		   Feb  11, 1997			Feb 7, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.41 %     1 month forward =  4.41 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  5.77 %     2 month forward =  5.94 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.33 %     3 month forward =  6.67 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.45 %     4 month forward =  6.78 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.65 %     5 month forward =  6.92 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.69 %     6 month forward =  6.91 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
